    "reason": "[ev-dea2079e5dc4] says only that the earlier Helm chart values turned on policy exceptions in all namespaces by default, and that users who relied on this are affected. It never names the values key or controller flag that changed, and it gives neither the old nor the new literal default. For details it sends the reader to an external advisory, CVE-2024-48921. None of the rendered-diff evidence shows a change to an exception-related values key or container argument. The diffs cover CRD apiCall.default fields, removed v2alpha1 versions including PolicyException [ev-b8120a2bb840], and Service appProtocol [ev-ea3f83a6e087, ev-bcf9822c2eb4], so the subject can't be pinned down. To write the assertion we still need the specific Helm values path, or the rendered controller args, with their before and after defaults.",
